<title>JAPAN: Izumiya - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Izumiya - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	   195.44		vs	  196.68</p>
<p> Operating	    5.81		vs	    6.31</p>
<p> Current		6.08		vs	    6.32</p>
<p> Net		    3.12		vs	    3.42</p>
<p> EPS		   27.17 yen	  vs	   31.59 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    118 million	  vs	 108 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 11.50 yen	  vs	   11.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Izumiya Co Ltd is a supermarket operator.</p>
